OpenMolcas's &GATEWAY COORD keyword silently truncates paths beyond 180 characters 
due to Fortran buffer length.
When absolute path to xyz file is too long, find a relative path from molcas scrach dir.
Error out if that is also too long.
Made with Claude Sonnet 5.
Author: Jarne Renders (Vrije Universiteit Brussel) 
